# Baseline Comparison Engine

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-baseline-comparison-engine.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-baseline-comparison-engine.md)

## Core question

**What is different from before?** — not “what information do we have?”

## Pipeline

Care Recipient Anchor → **Baseline Comparison** → Situation Model → Response

```
Previous Reality → New Observation → Difference → Possible Meaning → Attention
```

## MVP

- Reconstruct living baseline from usual / used-to / every-X discourse (and durable familiarity)
- Compare every new input (same-turn or later)
- Surface meaningful changes only
- Preserve timing/cause unknowns — **never** invent dementia progression as cause

## Never

Profile forms · flat event summaries as the product · diagnosis causation · scenario noun if-branches

